00:42:11,901 --> 00:42:18,260
Speaker 0: Then that works out pretty great, actually, because the operating systems these days are pretty good at scheduling processes.

566
00:42:18,801 --> 00:42:27,119
Speaker 0: So if you can break your program up and do a bunch of separate programs that all work independently, you can just run your program like five times.

