Speaker 0: I mean, you just look at the applications you use on a daily basis and or just your computer and think, you know, even within one program, you know, like Discord, it's like what's happening in Discord?

676
00:52:12,150 --> 00:52:18,369
Speaker 0: Well, you've got all these different channels and servers and they're all checking for new messages or messages are coming in.

677
